From 79476d00fd6126022012256f7a55814a6dc2ab38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Apr 2026 22:56:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add async data loading across all repositories and
 ViewModels

- Add GetAllAsync, InsertAsync, UpdateAsync, DeleteAsync to all repositories
  (BoneyardRepository, PartsRepository, InventoryRepository)
- Add async methods to TicketsDataService and AlBarakaDataService
- DashboardViewModel.Refresh() now delegates to RefreshAsync() using Task.Run
  offloading DB reads off the UI thread; adds IsLoading property
- MainViewModel: RefreshTicketsChart and RefreshAlBarakaTotals are now async;
  database connection status check runs off the UI thread via Task.Run
- RepairTicketsViewModel: initial ticket load and parts catalog load are now
  async via LoadTicketsAsync and LoadPartsCatalogAsync; adds IsLoading property
- All sync public methods preserved as thin wrappers for backward compatibility
---
